Package: Mobius
Type: Package
Title: Mobius Transport for Directional Data
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-08-22
Authors@R: person("Michail", "Tsagris", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mtsagris@uoc.gr")
Author: Michail Tsagris [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Michail Tsagris <mtsagris@uoc.gr>
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: Directional, grDevices, Rfast, rgl, stats
Suggests: Rfast2
Description: The Mobius transport is used to generate the Mobius-von Mises-Fisher and Mobius isotropic scaled von Mises-Fisher distributions. Functions to perform maximum likelihood estimation, random values generation and other functions are included. The relevant paper is Garcia-Portugues E. and Kato S. (2026). "Mobius transport on spheres", <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2607.29280>.
